{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15234080","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15234080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1523408001:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1523408002:1":{"text":"아반드 님, 걱정하지 않으셔도 됩니다. 오울러의 헛소리도 듣지 마세요.","source_cn":"殿下，您不必忧愁，更不必听信奥勒留的胡言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29CEDF1A10C7EA14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1523408003:1":{"text":"이번 일은 호위들이 게으른 탓에 여기까지 들어와 헛소리를 늘어놓은 것 같습니다. 호위들을 엄중히 문책하겠습니다.","source_cn":"这次想必是护卫失责，才让他找到机会来您面前说三道四，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD53433BDBA7A3289","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1523408004:1":{"text":"아니, 괜찮아요. 호위들은 잘못이 없으니까요.","source_cn":"不，不要责罚他们。护卫没有错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A3546A023B880BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1523408005:1":{"text":"...제가 오울러를 막지 말라고 명령했어요.","source_cn":"……是我下令，让他们不要阻拦奥勒留的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50A72D5D830E44B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1523408006:1":{"text":"아반드 님?!","source_cn":"殿下？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FB113AFD4B9077C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1523408007:1":{"text":"이렇게 오랫동안 항의를 한 이상, 선생님이 전해주시는 말로는 저들의 주장을 알 수 없으니까요.","source_cn":"他们抗议了这么久，我不能只通过老师您的转述来了解他们的主张。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x369EC65869DE87EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1523408008:1":{"text":"그래서 제가 서명한 휴전 협정이 그렇게 형편없는 건지 알고 싶었어요...","source_cn":"我想知道，我签署的停战合约真的有那么不堪吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA0F4E47D7B73A96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1523408009:1":{"text":"평화와 생존을 위해 잠깐 양보하는 게 그렇게 잘못된 일이었나요?","source_cn":"为了和平和生存，暂时妥协，难道是错的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x517431C09D058D8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1523408010:1":{"text":"전 잘 모르겠어요... 아버지가 저에게 영주 자리를 물려주신 것이 정말 잘못된 것인지 모르는 것처럼요...","source_cn":"我不知道……就像我也不知道，父亲要我继承领主之位，是不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE8536FC366A48C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1523408011:1":{"t